      "tactic_notes": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><!--{cke_protected}{C}%3C!%2D%2D%20x-tinymce%2Fhtml%20%2D%2D%3E--><strong>Putin(7)</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Pauline Bakery Mascot】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A Niedzzly Cub found in the frozen waste by Grigoriy, They decided to adopted him. Now, Putin often spend his day at the storefront of Pauline's bakery as some sort of mascot for the store</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Character Notes】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Playfulness</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Putin likes to play wrestle with Grigoriy, in fact their personal greeting when Grigoriy gets home is to suplexing him.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Eating Well</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Pauline has been feeding lots and lot of food to Putin, while this is somewhat a problem for other villagers, Putin would gladly gobble up anything Pauline gave him, which results in him becoming more chibbier these days.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Helpful helper</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">When not managing the store front of Pauline Bakeries, Putin would help her out with baking in the kitchen, and has become quite good at it, too.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Favourite Food】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>\"Smoked Salmon\"</strong>&nbsp;Fresh salmon fillets delicately seasoned with a blend of aromatic herbs and spices, cured and slowly smoked over fragrant wood chips until achieving a tender, flavorful perfection.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Sample Dialog】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Hrrr\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-cke-filler-webkit=\"end\" data-cke-temp=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>",
